# ValakasPrivateLavasaurus (29029, its shipped Magma Attack 4607), every draw 0, raised by nobody
# (its spawn names no target), 1500 away from the character, out of its 1000 sight. The character
# coming within 400 draws its magic strike on it from where it stands, weight 1000000, and a held
# attack at 50, which has it take up the strike at once. A hit while it casts at its top desire
# target adds the attack alone, 100; no clan call reaches it in its first AI cycles.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorDDMagicHold.WarriorDDMagicHold
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorDDMagicHold.WarriorDDMagicHoldAggressive.ValakasPrivateLavasaurus
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorDDMagicHold.WarriorDDMagicHoldAggressive.WarriorDDMagicHoldAggressive
npc lava 29029 Monster 1500 0 0 skill DD_MAGIC 4607 1

approach lava 400
  S MagicSkillUse caster=lava target=player skill=4607-1 hit=1982 reuse=0 success=0
  desires lava attack(player)=50 cast(player,4607)=1000000
hit lava 22
  desires lava attack(player)=150 cast(player,4607)=1000000
